<http://data.silknow.org/object/7131b38c-0fb2-3b6b-a6b3-817ef18f7975>
        a                              ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment                   "Dress, linen embroidered with coloured silks, Greece (Dodecanese, Nisyros), 1700s or 1800s."@en , "The dress is made of several pieces joined together. The dress has short sleeves with wide openings. It is open at the chest. The pattern is worked around the opening at the front and on the sleeves and forms a border along the lower end of the dress. It is based on floral motifs closely massed thogether. In each of the sleeves it forms a series of narrow bands springing from another around the sleeve end."@en ;
        ecrm:P138i_has_representation  <http://data.silknow.org/image/68b455d5-c9fb-3b6b-a222-52e0ebd9d2cf> , <http://data.silknow.org/image/baf9f7d9-9b71-388e-baf6-4abd9db2ff0a> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note               "Dress, linen embroidered with coloured silks, Greece (Dodecanese, Nisyros), 1700s or 1800s."@en , "The dress is made of several pieces joined together. The dress has short sleeves with wide openings. It is open at the chest. The pattern is worked around the opening at the front and on the sleeves and forms a border along the lower end of the dress. It is based on floral motifs closely massed thogether. In each of the sleeves it forms a series of narrow bands springing from another around the sleeve end."@en ;
        ecrm:P43_has_dimension         <http://data.silknow.org/object/7131b38c-0fb2-3b6b-a6b3-817ef18f7975/dimension/2> , <http://data.silknow.org/object/7131b38c-0fb2-3b6b-a6b3-817ef18f7975/dimension/1> ;
